WEBVTT

00:03:58.109 --> 00:04:00.403
And the long-term impact

00:04:00.444 --> 00:04:05.574
is that students likely won't have
that autonomous spirit

00:04:05.574 --> 00:04:07.868
they need in the work environment.

00:04:09.453 --> 00:04:12.748
This is not what most teachers
signed up for.

00:04:13.624 --> 00:04:14.792
It's not.

00:04:15.501 --> 00:04:18.421
I don't think there's a single
teacher candidate

00:04:18.462 --> 00:04:20.923
that said, "I want to be a teacher

00:04:20.965 --> 00:04:24.010
so I can help kids pass
standardized tests."

00:04:24.051 --> 00:04:26.095
(Laughter)

00:04:26.137 --> 00:04:30.224
(Applause)